WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.580
In the Eastern Han, Ban Chao led a small mission into the vast desert.

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:13.370
In an oasis kingdom of the Western Regions, Ban Chao spoke earnestly with the king and began his diplomacy.

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:19.350
Ban Chao formed alliances with the kings of many states, their banners flying side by side.

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:26.290
The Han army showed its strength in the Western Regions, guarding the safety of the Silk Road.

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:32.670
Caravan after caravan of camels, laden with silk — merchants traded busily in the Western Regions.

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:40.250
One oasis state after another was linked by the Silk Road like stars, and the Western Regions returned to Han's embrace.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:46.736
Under the sunset, Ban Chao looked at the flourishing Western Regions, a gratified smile on his face.

00:00:46.736 --> 00:00:50.520
His story became a legend of the Silk Road.

